{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(ccr start:*)",
      "Bash(ccr status:*)"
    ],
    "additionalDirectories": [
      "/Users/maxim"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "uv run --directory /Users/maxim/Claude/claude-memory-compiler python hooks/session-start.py",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "uv run --directory /Users/maxim/Claude/claude-memory-compiler python hooks/pre-compact.py",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "uv run --directory /Users/maxim/Claude/claude-memory-compiler python hooks/session-end.py",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "_comment": "Tom v1.2 Phase 16: projekt-lokale Claude-Code-Hooks für claude-memory-compiler. Diese Hooks mergen mit den globalen Hooks in ~/.claude/settings.json (GSD + RTK bleiben aktiv). Paths absolut damit aus jedem cwd lauffähig. SessionEnd/PreCompact verwenden längeren Timeout weil flush.py als detached Popen spawnt — der Hook selbst ist trotzdem schnell."
}
